OL,3,GNEWSABlack women's swimming documentary
OL,4,AOscar-longlisted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of a documentary that
OL,7,Fhonours the "powerful celebration of
OL,8,Fblack British women's relationship with
OL,9,Fwater" has been longlisted for an
OL,10,FOscar.
OL,12,FCat White, from Northampton, said the
OL,13,F11-minute film Swim Sistas could make
OL,14,Fit to the final nominations for the
OL,15,FBest Documentary Short Film at the 99th
OL,16,FAcademy Awards.
OL,18,FShe said it was "just the most
OL,19,Fbeautiful feeling" to see it so well
OL,20,Freceived.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
