OL,3,GNEWSABlack women's swimming documentary
OL,4,AOscar-longlisted
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt features Jasmine Boatswain, also
OL,7,Ffrom the town, who appeared in the
OL,8,Fsecond series of Traitors. She said it
OL,9,Fwas "insane" that an uplifting film
OL,10,Fabout freedom and women's empowerment
OL,11,Fwas getting so much attention.
